OL,5,T5FONE CONFIRMED DEAD IN SOUTH AFRICA Tj
OL,6,T5GSouth African police have confirmedTj
OL,7,T5Gthey have shot dead one person at aTj
OL,8,T5Gmemorial service for murdered blackTj
OL,9,T5Gleader Chris Hani.                 Tj
OL,10,T5F                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FThere are unconfirmed reports that Tj
OL,12,T5Fthree people were killed in the    Tj
OL,13,T5Fblack township of Soweto where the Tj
OL,14,T5Fshooting took place.               Tj
OL,15,T5F                                   Tj
OL,16,T5FThere are also reports of attacks  Tj
OL,17,T5Fon whites following Mr Hani's deathTj
OL,18,T5F                                   Tj
OL,19,T5FTwo white people were reportedly   Tj
OL,20,T5Fset on fire and killed near Cape   Tj
OL,21,T5FTown. A third had part of his      Tj
OL,22,T5Ftongue cut off.                    Tj
