OL,5,T5FPEACE TALKS WILL GO ON - DE KLERK  Tj
OL,6,T5GSouth Africa's President FW de     Tj
OL,7,T5GKlerk has said the killing of ChrisTj
OL,8,T5GHani will not disrupt the peace    Tj
OL,9,T5Gprocess.                           Tj
OL,10,T5F                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FHe said the murder may have been   Tj
OL,12,T5Fcarried out "to upset the talks    Tj
OL,13,T5Fprocess".                          Tj
OL,14,T5F                                   Tj
OL,15,T5FSpeaking on state television, Mr deTj
OL,16,T5FKlerk offered to use the police    Tj
OL,17,T5Fforce to upgrade the security of   Tj
OL,18,T5Fhigh profile politicians.          Tj
OL,19,T5F                                   Tj
OL,20,T5FHe urged political leaders to      Tj
OL,21,T5Fencourage calm among supporters.   Tj
