OL,5,T5FGUN USED TO KILL HANI IDENTIFIED   Tj
OL,6,T5GThe gun used to assassinate Chris  Tj
OL,7,T5GHani was part of a consignment of  Tj
OL,8,T5Gweapons stolen from the South      Tj
OL,9,T5GAfrican air force.                 Tj
OL,10,T5F                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FSouth African Police Commissioner  Tj
OL,12,T5FJohan Van der Merwe said a right-  Tj
OL,13,T5Fwing group had been implicated in  Tj
OL,14,T5Fthe theft of the weapons.          Tj
OL,15,T5F                                   Tj
OL,16,T5FHe said a hit-list of South AfricanTj
OL,17,T5Fleaders had been found on the man  Tj
OL,18,T5Fsuspected of killing Chris Hani.   Tj
OL,19,T5F                                   Tj
OL,20,T5FIt was unclear whether the suspect Tj
OL,21,T5Fbelonged to a right-wing group.    Tj
