OL,5,T5FCHURCH WELCOMES ADAMS-HUME MEETING Tj
OL,6,T5GThe head of the Catholic Church in Tj
OL,7,T5GIreland has welcomed the talks heldTj
OL,8,T5Gbetween SDLP leader John Hume and  Tj
OL,9,T5GSinn Fein president Gerry Adams.   Tj
OL,10,T5F                                   Tj
OL,11,T5FCardinal Cahal Daly said he hoped  Tj
OL,12,T5Fthey might lead the way to peace   Tj
OL,13,T5Fand he praised Mr Hume's "courage" Tj
OL,14,T5Fin taking a "political risk".      Tj
OL,15,T5F                                   Tj
OL,16,T5FArchbishop Dr Robin Eames, the     Tj
OL,17,T5FChurch of Ireland Primate, reacted Tj
OL,18,T5Fcautiously to the talks and said:  Tj
OL,19,T5F"Hope is the name of the game."    Tj
OL,20,T5F                                   Tj
OL,21,Tupppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppz
