OL,5,T5FADAMS HITS BACK AT TALKS CRITICISM Tj
OL,6,T5GSinn Fein president Gerry adams hasTj
OL,7,T5Ghit back at criticism of his talks Tj
OL,8,T5Gwith the SDLP leader John Hume.    Tj
OL,9,T5G                                   Tj
OL,10,T5FMr Adams said reaction to the      Tj
OL,11,T5Fmeeting had been uninformed. And heTj
OL,12,T5Fsaid the response of the Catholic  Tj
OL,13,T5FPrimate, Cardinal Cahal Daly, was  Tj
OL,14,T5F"opportunistic".                   Tj
OL,15,T5F                                   Tj
OL,16,T5FMr Adams could not say how the IRA Tj
OL,17,T5Fwould view the talks - he said he  Tj
OL,18,T5Fdid not speak for them.            Tj
OL,19,T5F                                   Tj
OL,20,T5FCardinal Daly had said he hoped theTj
OL,21,T5Ftalks between the two men would    Tj
OL,22,T5Flead to a lasting peace.           Tj
