OL,5,T5FNEW CALL TO DROP SCHOOL TESTING    Tj
OL,6,T5GThe Government is facing renewed   Tj
OL,7,T5Gcalls to abandon this year's       Tj
OL,8,T5GNational School Tests.             Tj
OL,9,T5G                                   Tj
OL,10,T5FThe Chairman of the National       Tj
OL,11,T5FConfederation of Parent Teachers   Tj
OL,12,T5FAssociations, Larry Goodband, said Tj
OL,13,T5Fministers should drop the tests.   Tj
OL,14,T5F                                   Tj
OL,15,T5FHis call follows the decision by   Tj
OL,16,T5Fthe biggest teaching union, the    Tj
OL,17,T5FNational Union of Teachers, to     Tj
OL,18,T5Fballot members on a tests boycott. Tj
OL,19,T5F                                   Tj
OL,20,T5FThe NUT's annual conference        Tj
OL,21,T5Fcontinues in Brighton tomorrow.    Tj
